hadiths[164]{hadithnumber,text}:
"235","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se arz kiya ke zameen par sab se pehli masjid kaun si banayi gayi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Masjid-ul-Haram (yani khana Kaaba) mein ne arz kiya ke phir kaun si (masjid banayi gayi to) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Masjid-ul-Aqsa (yani bait Bait-ul-Maqdis) mein ne phir arz kiya ke un donon ke darmiyan kitna faasla tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke chaalees baras ka aur to jahan bhi namaz ka waqt paalay wahein namaz ada kar le pas wo masjid hi hai "
"236","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Madina mein tashreef laaye to sheher ke buland hissa mein aik mohalla mein utray jis ko Bani Amr bin Auf ka mohalla kehtay hain wahan chaudah din rahay phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Bani Najjar ke logon ko bulaya to wo apni talwarein latkaye hue aaye Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke goya mein us waqt Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekh raha hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni oontni par thay aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay thay aur Banu Najjar ke log Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ird gird thay yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Abu Ayyub (raziyallahu anhu) ke makaan ke sehan mein utray Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aadat aadat-e-mubarak thi ke jahan namaz ka waqt aa jata wahan namaz padh letay aur bakriyon ke rehnay ki jagah mein bhi namaz padh letay (kyunke bakriyan ghareeb hoti hain un se andeesha nahi hai ke wo satayein) us ke baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne masjid bananay ka hukm kiya aur Banu Najjar ke logon ko bulaya wo aaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un se farmaya ke tum apna baagh mere haath baich daalo unhon ne kaha Allah ki qasam ham to us baagh ki qeemat na lein ge ham Allah hi se us ka badla chahtay hain (yani aakhirat ka sawab chahtay hain hamein rupiya darkaar nahi) Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us baagh mein jo cheezein thin un ko mein kehta hun us mein khajoor ke darakht thay aur mushrikon ki qabrein thin aur khandar thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hukm kiya to darakht kaate gaye aur mushrikon ki qabrein khod kar phaink di gayein aur khandar barabar kiye gaye aur darakhton ki lakri qibla ki taraf rakh di gayi aur darwaza ke donon taraf pathar lagao gaye jab ye kaam shuru hua to sahaba rajaz padhtay thay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi un ke saath thay wo log ye kehtay thay ke Ae Allah ! behtari aur bhalayi to aakhirat ki behtari aur bhalayi hai to Ansaar aur Muhajireen ki madad farma "
"237","[AI-translation] ´Salama bin Abdur Rahman kehtay hain ke` Abdur Rahman bin Abu Sa'eed raziyallahu anhu guzray to mein ne un se kaha ke Aap ne apne walid ko kaisay suna ke wo bayan kartay thay ke wo kaun si masjid hai jis ki bunyaad taqwa par rakhi gayi hai to unhon ne kaha ke mere walid raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki khidmat mein Aap ki biwion mein se kisi aik ke ghar mein haazir hua aur mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! wo masjid kaun si hai jis ko Allah Taala farmata hai ke taqwa par banayi gayi hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik mutthi kankar le kar zameen par maaray aur farmaya ke wo yehi tumhari masjid hai yani Madina ki masjid (Salama bin Abdur Rahman rawi hadees kehtay hain) mein ne kaha ke mein bhi gawahi deta hun ke mein ne bhi tumharay walid Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se suna hai ke wo us masjid ka aisa hi zikr kiya kartay thay "
"238","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` aik aurat beemar ho gayi to us ne kaha ke agar Allah Taala ne mujhe shifa di to mein bait Bait-ul-Maqdis mein ja kar namaz padhun gi phir wo achi ho gayi to us ne janay ki tayyari ki aur Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) ke paas haazir ho kar un ko salam kiya aur apne irada ki khabar di to unhon ne farmaya ke tum ne jo zaad-e-raah tayyar kiya hai wo khao aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki masjid mein namaz padho us liye ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke us masjid mein aik namaz ada karna aur masjidon mein hazaar namazein ada karnay se afzal hai siwae Masjid-ul-Haram ke "
"239","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam masjid qaba ki taraf sawaar aur paidal tashreef le jatay thay aur us mein do rakat namaz ada kartay thay "
"240","[AI-translation] ´Mehmood bin Lubaid raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Usman bin Affan raziyallahu anhu ne masjid bananay ka irada kiya to logon ne us baat ko bura samjha aur ye chaha ke masjid ko apne haal par chhor dein (yani jaisay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke door mein thi) to Usman raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai Aap farmatay thay ke jo shakhs Allah ke liye masjid binaye to Allah Taala us ke liye jannat mein aik ghar waisa hi binaye ga "
"241","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : sheheron mein sab se pyaari jagah Allah Taala ke qareeb masjidein hain aur sab se buri jagah Allah Taala ke qareeb bazaar hain "
"242","[AI-translation] ´Abu bin Ka'b raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Ansaar mein se aik shakhs thay ke un ka ghar Madina ke sab gharon se masjid se door tha aur un ki koi jamaat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath janay na paati thi (yani har namaz mein pahunchtay thay) to mujhe un par taras aaya aur mein ne un se kaha ke Kaash tum aik gadha khareed lo ke tumhein garmi se aur raah ke keeray makoron se bachaye to unhon ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! mein nahi chahta ke mera ghar Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ghar se muttasil ho mujh par us ki ye baat giraan guzari to mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko khabar di Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko bulaya unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bhi wohi kaha jo mujh se kaha tha aur kaha ke mein apne qadmon ka ajar chahta hun Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke beshak tum ko ajar hai jis ke tum umeedwaar ho "
"243","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo aadmi apne ghar mein wuzu karay phir Allah ke kisi ghar mein jaye ke Allah ke farzon mein se kisi farz ko ada karay to us ke qadam aisay hun ge ke aik se to burayi gire gi aur doosray se darja buland ho ga "
"244","[AI-translation] ´Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz padhtay thay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne logon ke qadmon ki aawaz suni to farmaya (yani namaz ke baad) tumhara kiya haal hai unhon ne kaha ke ham ne namaz ke liye jaldi ki thi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aisa na karo jab tum namaz ke liye aao to aaraam se aao phir jo milay (Imam ke saath) padh lo aur jo tum se aagay ho chuki usay poori kar lo "
"245","[AI-translation] ´Zainab as-Saqafiya raziyallahu anha kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo aurat masjid mein aana chahay to wo khushbu ko haath tak na lagao "
"246","[AI-translation] ´Umra bint Abdur Rahman raziyallahu anha ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se suna wo kehti thin ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam agar maujooda door ki banao singhaar karnay wali khawateen ko dekhtay to unhein masjid mein aanay se rok detay jaisa ke Bani Israil ki aurtein rok di gayi thin (rawi) Yahya bin Sa'eed ne raawiya Umra raziyallahu anha se poocha ke Ae Umra ! kiya Bani Israil ki auraton ko masjid mein aanay se rok diya gaya tha unhon ne kaha haan "
"247","[AI-translation] ´Abu Humaid (ya Abu Usaid) raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab koi masjid mein aaye to kahay ke ” Ae Allah mere liye apni rehmat ke darwazay khol de “ aur jab niklay to kahay ” Ae Allah mein tujh se tera fazl yani rizq aur duniya ki nematein maangta hun “ "
"248","[AI-translation] ´Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein masjid mein gaya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam logon mein baithay hue thay to mein bhi baith gaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tumhein baithnay se pehle do rakat padhnay se kis ne roka mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aur logon ko baithay dekha (to mein baith gaya) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya jab tum mein se koi masjid mein aaye to jab tak do rakat na padh le na baithay "
"249","[AI-translation] ´Abu Shasa kehtay hain ke` ham masjid mein Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath baithay hue thay ke muazzin ne azaan di aur aik shakhs masjid se utha aur janay laga to Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) us ko dekhtay rahay yahan tak ke wo bahar chala gaya tab Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us shakhs ne Abul Qasim sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki nafarmani ki "
"250","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : masjid mein thookna gunah hai aur us ka kaffara ye hai ke (agar thookay to) mitti mein daba de "
"251","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Khaibar ki jang mein farmaya ke jo shakhs us pauday yani lehsan ke pauday ko khaye to wo masjid mein na aaye "
"252","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs pyaaz ya lehsan khaye to wo ham se juda rahay ya farmaya ke hamari masjid se juda rahay aur apne ghar baithay aik martaba Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aik handiya layi gayi jis mein tarkaariyaan thin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us mein badboo paayi to poocha ke us mein kiya daalnay hai jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko maloom hua to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko falan sahabi ke paas le jao jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne dekha ke us ne bhi us ka khana bura samjha (us wajah se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne nahi khaya) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to kha le kyunke mein to us se sargoshi karta hun jis se to nahi karta (yani farishton se) "
"253","[AI-translation] ´Ma'daan bin Abu Talha se riwayat hai ke` Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne Juma ke din khutba padha aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ka zikr kiya aur kaha ke mein ne khwab mein dekha ke aik murgh ne mujhe teen thongein maarein mein samajhta hun ke us ki taabeer ye hai ke meri maut ab qareeb hai baaz log mujh se ye kehtay hain ke tum apna ja-nasheen aur khaleefa kisi ko muqarrar kar do aur yaqeenan Allah Taala apne deen ko barbaad nahi karay ga aur na apni khilafat ko aur na us cheez ko jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko de kar bheja tha agar meri maut jald ho jaye to khilafat mashwara karnay par chhe aadmiyon ke andar rahay gi jin se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wafaat tak raazi rahay aur mein janta hun ke baaz log taan kartay hain us kaam mein jin ko mein ne khud apne us haath se maara hai Islam par phir agar unhon ne aisa kiya (yani us taan ko durust samjhay) to wo dushman hain Allah ke aur kafir gumrah hain aur mein apne baad kisi cheez ko itna mushkil nahi chhorta jitna ke kalala mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kisi baat ko itni baar nahi poocha jitni baar kalala ke mutaliq poocha aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bhi mujh par kisi baat mein itni sakhti nahi ki jitni us mein ki yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni ungli se mere seena mein thoonsa maara aur farmaya ke Ae Umar ! kiya tujhe wo aayat kaafi nahi jo garmi ke mausam mein naazil Surah Nisa ke aakhir mein ke ” yastaftoonak Qul Allah yufteekum fi al-kalaalah un amr halak laisa lahu walad wa lahu ukht fa laha nisf ma tark .... “ (Nisa : 176) aur mein agar zinda raha to kalala mein aisa faisla karun ga jis ke muwafiq har shakhs hukm karay khwah Quran padha ho ya na padha ho phir Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Ae Allah ! mein tujhe gawah karta hun un logon par jin ko mein ne mulkon ki hukumat di hai (yani naayibon aur sooba daaron aur aalimon par) mein ne un ko usi liye bheja ke wo insaaf karein aur logon ko deen ki baatein batlayein aur apne paighambar sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka tareeqa sikhayein aur jo maal fai hasil ho logon mein taqseem karein aur jis baat mein un ko mushkil pesh aaye us ko mujh se daryaft karein phir Ae logon ! mein dekhta hun tum do paudon ko khatay ho aur mein un ko makrooh samajhta hun wo pyaaz aur lehsan hain aur mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha ke jab un donon ki boo kisi shakhs mein se aati to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke hukm se wo masjid se Baqee ki taraf nikala jata tha ab agar koi un ko khaye to khoob pakka kar (un ki boo ko khatm kar le) "
"254","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs kisi ko koi gumshuda cheez ke mutaliq masjid mein pukaar sunay (yani wo apni buland aawaz se apni cheez ke liye logon ko pukaaray) to kahay ke Allah karay teri cheez na milay us liye ke masjidein us wastay nahi banayi gayein "
"255","[AI-translation] ´Aisha aur Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke` jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wafaat ka waqt qareeb hua to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne dhaari daar chaadar apne munh par daalna shuru ki jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ghabra jatay to chaadar ko munh par se hata detay us haal mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Yahud o Nasaara par Allah Taala ki lanat ho ke unhon ne apne paighambaron ki qabron ko masjid bana liya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam daratay thay ke kahein apne log bhi aisa na karein "
"256","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Umm Habiba aur Umm Salama raziyallahu anhuma ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aik girja ka zikr kiya jis ko unhon ne Habsha mein dekha tha us mein tasveerein lagi hui thin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke un logon ka yehi haal tha ke jab un mein koi naik aadmi mar jata to wo us ki qabr par masjid banatay aur wahan sooratein banatay ye log qayamat ke din Allah ke saamnay sab se badtar hun ge "
"257","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe chhe baaton ki wajah se aur paighambaron par fazeelat di gayi hai 1 ye ke mujhe wo kalaam mila jis mein lafz thoray aur maani bohat zyada hain (yani kalaam Allah ya khud Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke kalimaat) 2 mein madad diya gaya ro'b se 3 mere liye ghaneemat ke amwaal halal kiye gaye 4 mere liye saari zameen paak karnay wali aur masjid (namaz padhnay ki jagah) banayi gayi 5 mein tamam makhlooqat ki taraf (khwah jin hun ya Arab ke aadmi ya ghair Arab ke) bheja gaya 6 mere upar nabuwwat khatm ki gayi "
"258","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi namaz padhnay ke liye khara ho aur us ke saamnay paalaan ki pichli lakri ke barabar koi shay ho to wo aar ke liye kaafi hai agar itni bari (ya us se oonchi) koi shay us ke saamnay na ho aur gadha ya aurat ya siyah kutta saamnay se guzar jaye to us ki namaz toot jaye gi mein ne kaha ke Ae Zarr raziyallahu anhu ! ye siyah kuttay ki kiya khusoosiyat hai agar laal kutta ho ya zard ho unhon ne kaha ke Ae mere bhatijay ! mein ne bhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aisay hi poocha jaisay to ne mujh se poocha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : siyah kutta shaitaan hota hai "
"259","[AI-translation] ´Sahl bin Sa'd as-Saa'idi raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jis jagah namaz ke liye kharay hotay thay us mein aur qibla ki deewar mein itni jagah rehti ke aik bakri nikal jaye "
"260","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha)` (ke saamnay zikr hua ke kuttay gadhay aur aurat namazi ke aagay se nikal janay se namaz toot jati hai) to unhon ne kaha ke tum ne hamein gadhon aur kutton ke barabar kar diya Allah ki qasam mein ne khud dekha hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz padhtay thay aur mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay takht par qibla ki taraf laiti hoti thi mujhe haajat hoti to Aap ke saamnay baithna aur Aap ko takleef dena mujhe bura lagta us liye mein takht ke paaiyon ke paas se khisak jati "
"261","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik shakhs ne masjid mein daakhil ho kar namaz padhi aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam masjid ke aik gosha mein tashreef farma thay us ke baad poori hadees bayan kartay hue aakhir mein farmaya ke jab tum namaz padhnay ke liye kharay ho to achi tarah wuzu karo phir qibla ro kharay ho aur us ke baad takbeer kaho "
"262","[AI-translation] ´Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf sola maheena tak namaz padhi yahan tak ke Surah Baqarah mein ye aayat naazil ke ” tum jahan par ho apna munh Ka'be ki taraf karo “ (Baqarah : 144) to ye aayat us waqt naazil jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz padh chukay thay aik shakhs Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saathiyon mein se ye sun kar chala rastay mein Ansaar ke kuch logon ko (bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf hasab mamool) namaz padhtay hue paya to us ne un se ye hadees bayan ki (ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Ka'be ki taraf munh karnay ka hukm hua hai ye sun kar) un logon ne (namaz hi mein) apne Aap ko Ka'be ki taraf pher liya "
"263","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab farz namaz ki takbeer ho to koi namaz nahi hoti siwae us farz namaz ke Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf sola maheena tak namaz padhi yahan tak ke Surah Baqarah mein ye aayat naazil ke ” tum jahan par ho apna munh Ka'be ki taraf karo “ (Baqarah : 144) to ye aayat us waqt naazil jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz padh chukay thay aik shakhs Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saathiyon mein se ye sun kar chala rastay mein Ansaar ke kuch logon ko (bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf hasab mamool) namaz padhtay hue paya to us ne un se ye hadees bayan ki (ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Ka'be ki taraf munh karnay ka hukm hua hai ye sun kar) un logon ne (namaz hi mein) apne Aap ko Ka'be ki taraf pher liya "
"264","[AI-translation] ´Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab namaz ki takbeer ho to kharay na ho jab tak mujhe dekh na lo (Imam ke aanay se pehle kharay na hun) Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf sola maheena tak namaz padhi yahan tak ke Surah Baqarah mein ye aayat naazil ke ” tum jahan par ho apna munh Ka'be ki taraf karo “ (Baqarah : 144) to ye aayat us waqt naazil jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz padh chukay thay aik shakhs Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saathiyon mein se ye sun kar chala rastay mein Ansaar ke kuch logon ko (bait Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf hasab mamool) namaz padhtay hue paya to us ne un se ye hadees bayan ki (ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Ka'be ki taraf munh karnay ka hukm hua hai ye sun kar) un logon ne (namaz hi mein) apne Aap ko Ka'be ki taraf pher liya "
"265","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Bilal raziyallahu anhu jab zawaal ka waqt hota to azaan detay aur iqamat na kehtay yahan tak ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laatay jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laatay aur Bilal raziyallahu anhu dekh letay tab takbeer kehtay "
"266","[AI-translation] ´Salama bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat hai ke` unhon Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ko ye kehtay hue suna ke aik dafa namaz ki takbeer kahi gayi aur ham ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke nikalnay se pehle safein barabar kein phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam niklay yahan tak ke jab apni jagah par kharay hue aur abhi takbeer tehreema nahi kahi thi ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko yaad aa gaya to wapas palate aur ham se farmaya ke apni apni jagah kharay raho ham sab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke aanay tak intezar mein kharay rahay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ghusl kar ke aaye thay aur (ghusl ki wajah se) sar mubarak se pani tapak raha tha phir takbeer kahi aur hamein namaz padhayi "
"267","[AI-translation] ´Abu Mas'ud raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` namaz ke liye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamaray kandhon par haath phertay aur farmatay ke barabar kharay raho aur aagay peechay na hato warna tumharay dilon mein phoot par jaye gi naiz mere qareeb wo kharay hun jo ke bohat samajhdaar aur aqalmand hain aur phir jo un se qareeb hun us ke baad Abu Mas'ud raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke aaj tum logon mein beinteha ikhtilaafaat ronuma ho gaye hain "
"268","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : agar logon ko azaan aur pehli saf (mein kharay honay ka ajar o sawab) maloom ho jaye to phir aur koi chaara na rahay ke wo qura andaazi karein to qura andaazi bhi karein aur agar awwal waqt namaz padhnay ki fazeelat se log waaqif hotay to aik doosray par sabqat kartay aur agar Isha o Fajr ki bartari jantay to un donon ke liye sireen ke bal ragartay hue aatay "
"269","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mardon ki safon mein sab se behtar pehli saf hai aur sab se buri aakhri saf hai aur khawateen ke liye sab se buri pehli saf hai (jabke mardon ki safein un ke qareeb hun) aur achi saf pichli saf hai (jo ke mardon se door ho) "
"270","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : agar Musalmanon par shaaq (yani mushkil) na hota aur Zuhair ki riwayat mein yun hai ke agar meri ummat par mushkil na hota to mein un ko hukm karta ke har namaz ke waqt miswaak kiya karein "
"271","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik shakhs aaya aur namaz ki saf mein mil gaya aur us ka saans phoola hua tha to us ne kaha ” sab tareef Allah ke liye hai bohat tareef aur paak baabarkat “ phir jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz padh chukay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum mein se kaun tha jis ne ye kalimaat kahay pas saari qaum ke log chup ho rahay phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne dobara farmaya ke kis ne ye kalimaat kahay kyunke us ne koi buri baat nahi kahi to us shakhs ne arz kiya ke mein aaya aur mera saans charha hua tha to mein ne ye kalimaat kahay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein ne baara farishton ko dekha ke aik doosray se jaldi kar rahay thay ke un mein se kaun un (kalimaat) ko upar (yani Allah Azza wa Jal ke paas) le jaye "
"272","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab namaz ke liye kharay hotay to apne donon haath apne donon kandhon tak uthatay phir Allah Akbar kehtay aur jab ruku ka irada farmatay tab bhi aisa hi kartay aur jab ruku se sar uthatay tab bhi aisa hi kartay aur jab sajda se sar uthatay to aisa na kartay yani rafa yadain (donon) sajdon ke darmiyan mein na kartay thay "
"273","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz ko Allah Akbar keh kar shuru kartay aur qiraat ” Alhamdulillah Rab Aalameen “ ke saath shuru kartay (yani Bism Allah ir Rahman ir Raheem aahista se kehtay) aur jab ruku kartay to sar ko na ooncha rakhtay na neecha balke (peeth ke barabar rakhtay) baich mein aur jab ruku se sar uthatay to sajda na kartay yahan tak ke seedhay kharay ho jatay aur jab sajda se sar uthatay to doosra sajda na kartay yahan tak ke seedha baith jatay aur har do rakat ke baad (qa'day mein) at-tahiyyaat padhtay aur baayan paon bichha kar daahna paon khara kartay aur shaitaan ki (tarah) baithak se mana kartay thay aur us baat se bhi mana kartay thay ke aadmi apne donon haath zameen par darinday ki tarah bichhaye aur namaz ko salam par khatm kartay thay "
"274","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab namaz padhnay ke liye kharay hotay to takbeer kehtay aur phir ruku ke waqt takbeer kehtay aur ruku se sar uthatay hue sami Allah liman hamidah kehtay aur phir yunhi kharay kharay Rabna wa lak ul hamd kehtay aur phir jab sajda kartay to takbeer kehtay aur sajda se sar uthatay waqt bhi takbeer kehtay aur phir khatm namaz tak usi tarah (har nishast o barkhaast) ke waqt takbeer kehtay thay aur do rakat ke baad jab qayaam kartay to phir Allah Akbar kehtay phir us ke baad Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tum sab logon ki ba nisbat mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki namaz ki tarah namaz padhta hun "
"275","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamein taleem detay aur farmatay thay ke Imam se pehle koi kaam na karna jab wo takbeer kahay ‘ us waqt takbeer kehna aur jab wo wa la azzaalleen kahay to tum baad mein aameen kaho aur jab wo ruku karay to tum baad mein ruku karo aur jab wo ” sami Allah liman hamidah “ kahay to tum us ke baad ” Rabna lak ul hamd “ kaho "
"276","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ghoray par se girnay ki wajah se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka daayein jaanib ka badan chhil gaya to ham Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki iyadat ke liye gaye chunke namaz ka waqt ho gaya tha us liye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne baithay baithay namaz padhayi aur ham ne bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay baith kar namaz padhi jab ham sab log namaz padh chukay to irshaad farmaya ke Imam usi liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye jab wo takbeer kahay to tum bhi takbeer kaho aur jab wo sajda karay to tum bhi sajda karo aur jab wo sar uthaye to tum bhi sar uthao aur jab wo tasmee padhay to tum tahmeed padho aur jab wo baith kar namaz padhaye to tum bhi baith kar hi namaz ada karo (ye ibtidaayi hukm hai baad mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki marz ul maut mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne baith kar namaz padhayi Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath kharay ho kar aur sahaba ne peechay kharay ho kar namaz padhi)"
"277","[AI-translation] ´Wail bin Hujr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko us taur par dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne namaz shuru kartay waqt apne donon haath uthaye aur Allah Akbar kaha (us hadees ke rawi Hammaam ka bayan hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne donon haath kaanon tak uthaye) phir chaadar orh li us ke baad seedha haath ultay haath par rakha phir jab ruku ka irada kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne donon haath chaadar mein se bahar nikaal kar donon kaanon tak utha kar takbeer padhi aur ruku mein gaye aur jab bahaalat qayaam sami Allah liman hamidah kaha to bhi rafa yadain kiya aur phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne donon hatheliyon ke darmiyan mein sajda kiya "
"278","[AI-translation] ´Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz mein kharay hotay to farmatay ke ” mein ne apna munh us zaat ki taraf kiya jis ne aasmaan o zameen banaya yak sau ho kar aur mein mushrikon mein se nahi hun beshak meri namaz meri qurbani mera jina aur marna Allah Rab Aalameen ke liye hai jis ka koi shareek nahi aur us ka mujhe hukm diya gaya hai aur Musalmanon mein se hun ya Allah to baadshah hai tere siwa koi mabood nahi to mera paalnay wala hai aur mein tera ghulam hun mein ne apni jaan par zulm kiya aur apne gunaahon ka iqraar karta hun to mere sab gunaahon ko bakhsh de us liye ke gunaahon ko koi nahi bakhshta magar to aur sikha dijiye mujhe achi aadatein ke nahi sikhaata un ko magar to aur mujh se buri aadatein door rakh aur nahi door rakh sakta un (buri aadaton) ko magar to mein teri khidmat ke liye haazir hun aur tera farmanbardaar hun aur saari khoobi tere haathon mein hai aur shar se teri taraf qareebi hasil nahi ho sakti (ya shar akeela teri taraf mansoob nahi hota masalan Khaaliq al-qirada wal-khanaazeer nahi kaha jata ya Rab ash-sharr nahi kaha jata ya shar teri taraf nahi charhta jaisay kalima tayyiba aur amal naik teri taraf charhtay hain ya koi makhlooq tere wastay shar nahi agarchay hamaray liye shar ho kyunke ham Bishr hain us liye ke har cheez ko to ne hikmat ke saath banaya hai) meri taufeeq teri taraf se hai aur meri iltija teri taraf hai to bari barkat wala aur teri zaat buland o baala hai mein tujh se maghfirat maangta hun aur teri taraf rujoo karta hun “ aur jab ruku kartay to farmatay ke ” Ae Allah ! mein tere liye jhukta hun aur tujh par yaqeen rakhta hun aur tera farmanbardaar hun tere liye mere kaan aur meri aankhein aur mera maghz aur meri haddiaan aur mere patthay sab jhuk gaye “ aur jab (ruku se) sar uthatay to farmatay ke ” Ae Allah ! Ae hamaray Rab ! tareef tere hi liye hai aasmanon bhar aur zameen bhar aur un ke darmiyan bhar aur us ke baad jitna to chahay us ke bharnay ke baqadr “ aur jab sajda kartay to farmatay ke ” Ae Allah ! mein ne tere liye hi sajda kiya aur tujh par yaqeen laya aur mein tera farmanbardaar hun mera munh us zaat ke liye sajda raiz hai jis ne usay banaya hai aur tasveer kheenchi hai aur us ke kaan aur aankhon ko cheera bari barkat wala hai sab bananay walon se acha “ phir aakhir mein tashahhud aur salam ke baich mein farmatay ke ” Ae Allah ! bakhsh de mujh ko jo mein ne aagay kiya aur jo mein ne peechay kiya aur jo chhupaya aur jo zaahir kiya aur jo had se zyada kiya aur jo to janta hai mujh se barh kar to sab se pehle tha aur sab ke baad rahay ga tere siwa koi mabood nahi hai “ aik doosri riwayat mein yun hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab namaz shuru kartay to Allah Akbar kehtay aur farmatay ke ” mein ne apna munh us ki taraf kiya jis ne ........ aakhir tak “ padhtay "
"279","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu aur Umar Farooq raziyallahu anhu aur Usman raziyallahu anhu ke saath namaz padhi lekin un mein se kisi aik ko bhi namaz mein Bism Allah ir Rahman ir Raheem (jahr se) padhtay hue nahi suna "
"280","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aik din ham log Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki majlis mein baithay thay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par aik oongh si taari hui phir muskuratay hue Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sar mubarak uthaya jis par ham ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap kis cheez par muskura rahay hain irshaad farmaya ke mujh par abhi abhi Quran Majeed ki aik surat naazil hui hai Chunanche Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Bism Allah ir Rahman ir Raheem padh kar ” (Ae Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam !) beshak ham ne Aap ko kausar inayat farmayi hai........ “ poori surat tilawat farmayi aur farmaya ke tum log jantay ho ke kausar kiya cheez hai ham ne kaha ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah hi zyada jantay hain to irshaad farmaya ke kausar aik neher hai jis ka Rab ne mujh se waada kiya hai us mein bohat si khoobiyan hain aur baroz mehshar mere Ummti us hauz ka pani peenay ke liye aayein ge us hauz par itnay gilaas hain jitnay aasmaan ke taare aik shakhs ko wahan se bhaga diya jaye ga jis pe mein kahun ga ke Ae Allah ! ye shakhs mera Ummti hai Allah Taala farmaye ga ke Aap nahi jantay ke unhon ne Aap ke baad (deen mein) kiya kiya nayi baatein (bidat) eejaad kein "
"281","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jis ne namaz mein Surah Fatiha nahi padhi to us ki namaz poori nahi hui balke us ki namaz naaqis rahi ye jumla Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne teen baar irshaad farmaya logon ne poocha ke Ae Abu Huraira jab ham Imam ke peechay hun to kiya karein Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us waqt tum log aahista Surah Fatiha padh liya karo kyunke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Allah Azza wa Jal ka ye qaul farmatay hue suna hai ke mein ne namaz apne aur apne banday ke darmiyan aadhi aadhi taqseem kar di hai aur mera banda jo sawal karta hai wo poora kiya jata hai jab banda Alhamdulillah Rab Aalameen kehta hai to Allah Azza wa Jal farmata hai ke mere banday ne meri tareef ki aur (namazi) jab ir Rahman ir Raheem kehta hai to Allah Taala farmata hai ke mere banday ne meri tauseef ki aur (namazi) jab Maalik yaum ad-deen kehta hai to Allah Azza wa Jal farmata hai ke mere banday ne meri buzrugi bayan ki aur yun bhi kehta hai ke mere banday ne apne sab kaam mere supurd kar diye hain aur (namazi) jab iyyaak na'bud wa iyyaak nastaeen padhta hai to Allah Azza wa Jal kehta hai ke ye mere aur mere banday ka darmiyani muamla hai aur mera banda jo sawal karay ga wo us ko milay ga phir jab (namazi) apni namaz mein ihdina as-siraat al-mustaqeem () siraat allazina an'amta alaihim ghair al-maghdhoob alaihim wa la azzaalleen padhta hai to Allah Taala jawab deta hai ke ye sab mere us banday ke liye hai aur ye jo kuch talab kar raha hai wo usay diya jaye ga "
"282","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam masjid mein tashreef laaye ke itnay mein aik aadmi aaya us ne namaz padhnay ke baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko salam kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne salam ka jawab detay hue farmaya ke jao namaz padho tum ne namaz nahi padhi us ne wapas ho kar pehle ki tarah phir namaz padhi aur laut kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko salam kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wa alaikum salam kehtay hue farmaya ke jao namaz padho tum ne namaz ada nahi ki hatta ke teen dafa aisay hi kiya to aadmi ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! qasam hai us zaat ki jis ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Rasoolullah barhaq banaya hai ke mein us tareeqa ke ilawa mazeed kisi cheez se naawaaqif hun baraah karam Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hi mujhe bata dijiye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne irshaad farmaya : ” jab tum namaz ke liye kharay ho to pehle Allah Akbar kaho aur phir jitna Quran tum ba-aasaani padh saktay ho wo padho us ke baad itminaan se ruku karo aur phir ba-aaraam bilkul seedhay kharay ho jao us ke baad ba-itminaan sajda karo aur phir ba-itminaan qa'da mein baitho aur usi tarah apni poori namaz mein kiya karo (us hadees se ye cheez maloom hui ke namaz mein ta'deel arkaan bohat zaroori hai us ke baghair namaz nahi hoti aur jamhoor ulama ke qareeb ta'deel arkaan farz hai) "
"283","[AI-translation] ´Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein Zohar ya Asr ki namaz padhayi pas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum mein se kis ne mere peechay sabbih ism rabbak al-a'la padhi thi aik shakhs ne kaha ke mein ne ye Surah padhi thi aur mein ne us ke padhnay se bhalayi ka irada kiya tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein janta hun ke tum mein se kuch aadmi mujhe uljhaatay hain (us riwayat ke mutaliq Imam Nawawi rahimahullah Allah ne likha hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne qiraat se mana nahi kiya balke ba-aawaaz buland qiraat se mana kiya tha aur hadees mein ye cheez saabit hai ke sahabi ne ba-aawaaz buland qiraat ki thi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bataya : ye falan surat mere peechay kis ne padhi)"
"284","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Imam jab aameen kahay to muqtadi bhi aameen kahein aur jis ki aameen farishton ki aameen ke barabar ho jaye gi to us ke guzishta gunah maaf kar diye jayein ge bin Shihab rahimahullah Allah ka bayan hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (walazzaalleen ke baad) aameen kaha kartay thay "
"285","[AI-translation] ´Simaak bin Harb kehtay hain ke` mein ne Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki namaz ke baaray mein poocha to unhon ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam halki namaz padha kartay thay un logon ki tarah (bari bari surtein) nahi padhtay thay aur Fajr ki namaz mein Qaaf wal-Quran al-Majeed ya us ke barabar ki surtein padhtay thay "
"286","[AI-translation] ´Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Zohar aur Asr ki pehli do rakaton mein Surah Fatiha aur aik aik surat padhtay thay aur kabhi aik aadh aayat hamein suna detay thay aur pichli do rakaton mein sirf Surah Fatiha padhtay thay "
"287","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Zohar ki pehli do rakaton mein har rakat mein tees aayaton ke barabar qiraat kartay thay aur pichli do rakaton mein pandra aayaton ke barabar ya yun kaha ke us ka aadha aur Asr ki pehli do rakaton mein har rakat mein pandra aayaton ke barabar aur pichli do rakaton mein us ka aadha (qiraat kartay thay) "
"288","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` (un ki walida) Umm fazl ne unhein (bin Abbas ko) wal-mursalaat urfa padhtay suna to kaha ke beta to ne ye surat padh kar mujhe yaad dila diya ke sab se aakhir mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ye surat suni thi ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne usay Maghrib ki namaz mein padha tha "
"289","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Muaz bin Jabal raziyallahu anhu Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz padhtay phir apni qaum mein aa kar un ki imamat kartay wo aik raat ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Isha ki namaz padh kar aaye phir apni qaum ki imamat ki aur Surah Baqarah shuru kar di aik shakhs ne munh mor kar salam pher diya aur akelay namaz padh kar chala gaya logon ne kaha ke kiya to munafiq ho gaya hai wo bola ke Allah ki qasam mein munafiq nahi hun mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas jaun ga aur Aap se kahun ga phir wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham oonton walay hain (din bhar oonton se pani nikaaltay hain) aur Muaz raziyallahu anhu Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Isha ki namaz padh kar aaye aur Surah Baqarah shuru kar di ye sun kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Muaz raziyallahu anhu ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya ke Ae Muaz ! kiya to fasaadi hai (jo logon ko ye ye surat padha kar nafrat dilana chahta hai aur fitna khara karta hai) falan falan surat padho Sufyan ne kaha ke mein ne Amr se kaha ke Abu Zubair ne Jabir se bayan kiya ke Aap ne farmaya ke wash-shams wa dhuhaaha wad-dhuha wallail iza yaghsha sabbih ism rabbak al-a'la padha kar Amr ne kaha ke un jaisi surtein padha kar "
"290","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aik din hamein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne namaz padhayi jab namaz se farigh hue to hamari taraf mutawajjah ho kar farmaya ke Ae logon ! mein tumhara Imam hun us liye mujh se pehle ruku sajda qauma aur salam na phairo mein aagay aur peechay se tum ko dekhta hun aur qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke qabza mein meri jaan hai ke jo cheezein mein dekhta hun agar tum unhein dekh lo to hanso kam aur roo zyada logon ne poocha Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap ne kiya dekha hai farmaya ke mein ne jannat aur dozakh dekhi hai "
"291","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo koi Imam se pehle sajda se apna sar uthata hai usay darrna chahiye kahein aisa na ho ke Allah Taala us ki soorat palat kar gadhay ki manind kar de "
"292","[AI-translation] ´Aswad aur Alqama se riwayat hai ke` ham donon Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas un ke ghar mein aaye unhon ne poocha ke kiya un logon (yani us door ke nawabon aur ameeron) ne tumharay peechay namaz padh li ham ne kaha nahi unhon ne kaha ke utho namaz padh lo kyunke namaz ka waqt ho gaya aur ameeron aur nawabon ke intezar mein apni namaz mein dair karna zaroori nahi phir hamein na azaan denay ka hukm kiya aur na iqamat ka ham un ke peechay kharay honay lagay to hamaray haath pakar kar aik ko daahni taraf kiya aur doosray ko baayein jaanib jab ruku kiya to ham ne haath ghutnon par rakhay unhon ne hamaray haathon par maara aur hatheliyon ko jor kar raanon ke baich mein rakha jab namaz padh chukay to kaha ke ab tumharay nawaab aur ameer aisay paida hun ge jo namaz mein us ke waqt se dair karein ge aur namaz ko tang karein ge yahan tak ke aaftab doobnay ke qareeb ho ga (yani Asr ki namaz mein itni dair karein ge) jab tum un ko aisa kartay dekho to apni namaz waqt par padh lo (yani afzal waqt par) phir un ke saath dobara nafl ke taur par padh lo aur jab tum teen aadmi ho to sab mil kar namaz padho (yani barabar kharay ho aur Imam baich mein rahay) aur jab teen se zyada hun to aik aadmi Imam banay aur wo aagay khara ho aur jab ruku karay to apne haathon ko raanon par rakhay aur jhukay aur donon hatheeliaan jor kar raanon mein rakh le goya ke mein us waqt Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ungliyon ke mukhtalif honay ko dekh raha hun "
"293","[AI-translation] ´Mus'ab bin Sa'd riwayat kartay hain ke` mein ne apne walid ke baazu mein namaz padhi aur apne haath donon ghutnon ke baich mein rakhay to mere walid mujh se kaha ke apni donon hatheliyon ko ghutnon par rakh Mus'ab ne kaha ke phir mein ne dobara waisay hi kiya to unhon ne mere haath par maara aur kaha ke hamein aisa karnay se mana kiya gaya aur (ruku mein) donon hatheliyon ko ghutnon par rakhnay ka hukm hua "
"294","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne ruku aur sajda mein Quran par amal kartay hue aksar ye dua farmatay thay subhaanak Allahumma Rabna wa bihamdik Allahumma ighfir li "
"295","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne (marz ul maut mein) parda uthaya aur log Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ke peechay saf baandhay kharay hue thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae logon ! ab nabuwwat ki khushkhabri denay wali cheezon mein kuch nahi raha (kyunke mujh par nabuwwat ka khaatima ho gaya) magar naik khwab jis ko Musalman dekhay ya usay dukhaya jaye aur tumhein maloom rahay ke mujhe ruku aur sajda mein Quran padhnay se mana kiya gaya hai ruku mein to apne Rab ki barayi bayan karo aur sajda ke andar dua mein koshish karo ye zyada laiq aur mumkin hai ke tumhari dua qabool ho gi "
"296","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab ruku se sar uthatay to farmatay ke ” Ae hamaray Rab tamam tareefein tere hi liye khaas hain aasmanon bhar aur zameen bhar aur phir jo cheez to chahay us ke baad (us ki bharayi ke barabar tareef) to hi buzrugi wala aur tareef ke laiq hai bohat sachi baat jo banday ne kahi aur ham sab tere banday hain (wo baat ye hai ke) Ae hamaray Allah ! jo to de us ka koi roknay wala nahi aur jo to rokay us ka denay wala koi nahi koshish karnay walay ki koshish tere saamnay faida nahi deti (balke jo to chahay wohi hota hai) "
"297","[AI-translation] ´Ma'daan bin Abu Talha al-Yamari kehtay hain ke` mein Saubaan raziyallahu anhu maula Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se mila aur mein ne kaha ke mujhe aisa kaam batlao jis ki wajah se Allah Taala mujhe jannat mein le jaye ya yun kaha ke mujhe wo kaam batao jo sab kaamon se zyada Allah ko pasand ho ye sun kar Sauban (raziyallahu anhu) chup ho rahay phir mein ne un se poocha to chup rahay phir teesri baar poocha to kaha ke mein ne bhi ye baat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poochi thi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya tha ke to sajday bohat kiya kar us wastay ke har aik sajda se Allah Taala tera aik darja buland karay ga aur tera aik gunah maaf karay ga Ma'daan ne kaha ke phir mein Abu Darda raziyallahu anhu se mila aur un se bhi ye poocha to unhon ne bhi aisa hi kaha jaisa Sauban (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha tha "
"298","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : banda apne Rab se zyada qareeb sajda ki haalat mein hota hai us liye sajda mein bohat dua kiya karo "
"299","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mujhe saat haddion par sajda karnay ka hukm hua hai peshani par aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne haath se naak ki taraf ishara kiya aur donon haathon par aur donon ghutnon par aur donon qadmon ki ungliyon par aur kapray aur baal na samaitnay ka hukm hua hai "
"300","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : sajda mein aaza ko barabar rakho aur koi tum mein se apne baazu kuttay ki tarah na bichhaye "
"301","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Maalik bin Buhaina raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab namaz padhtay to donon haathon ko (pehluon se) itna juda rakhtay ke mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki baghalon ki safedi dekh leta "
"302","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab namaz mein baithtay to baayein paon ko raan aur pindli ke baich mein kar letay aur daahna paon bichhatay aur baayan haath baayein ghutnay par rakhtay aur daahna haath apni daahni raan par rakhtay aur ungli se ishara kartay "
"303","[AI-translation] ´Taus kehtay hain ke` ham ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha ke iqa ki baithak ke baaray mein Aap kiya kehtay hain unhon ne kaha ke ye sunnat hai ham ne kaha ke ham to us baithak ko aadmi par (ya paon par) sitam samajhtay hain unhon ne kaha (nahi) balke wo to tumharay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sunnat hai (” iqa “ ye hai ke donon paon kharay kar ke airiyon par baithna) "
"304","[AI-translation] ´Hattaan bin Abdullah ar-Riqaashi kehtay hain ke` mein Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath namaz padh raha tha jab ham log tashahhud mein baithay thay to peechay se kisi aadmi ne kaha ke namaz neki aur zakaat ke saath farz ki gayi hai Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne namaz khatm honay ke baad poocha ke ye baat tum mein se kis ne kahi hai sab log khamosh ho rahay to Aap raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke (tum log sun rahay ho) batao ye baat tum mein se kis ne kahi hai jab sab log chup rahay to Aap raziyallahu anhu ne mujh se kaha ke Ae Hattaan ! shayad tum ne ye kalimay kahay hain mein ne kaha ke nahi mein ne nahi kahay mujhe to khauf tha ke kahein Aap khafa na ho jayein itnay mein aik shakhs ne kaha ke ye kalimaat mein ne kahay hain aur us mein meri niyyat sirf bhalayi aur neki ki thi Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne jawab diya ke tum log nahi jantay ke tum ko apni namaz mein kiya padhna chahiye halanke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein dauran khutba tamam umoor batlaye aur namaz padhna sikhayi hai wo us tarah ke tum log namaz padhnay se pehle safein seedhi kar lo phir tum mein se koi Imam banay aur jab wo Allah Akbar kahay to tum bhi kaho aur jab wo wa la azzaalleen keh chukay to tum aameen kaho taake Allah Taala tum se khush rahay Imam ki takbeer o ruku ke saath tum bhi takbeer kaho aur ruku karo Imam ki takbeer aur ruku ke baad tum takbeer o ruku ada karo aur Imam se pehle takbeer o ruku ada na karo kyunke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya hai ke tumhara aik lamha takheer karna Imam ke ruku o takbeeraat ke barabar hi shumaar kiya jata hai phir jab Imam sami Allah liman hamidah kahay to tum Allahumma Rabna wa lak ul hamd kaho aur Allah Taala tumhari duaon ko sunta hai kyunke Allah Taala ne apne Rasoolullah ki zubaani kaha hai ke jo koi Allah Taala ki tareef o tauseef karta hai to Allah Taala us ko sunta hai Imam jab takbeer kahay aur sajda karay to tum bhi takbeer aur sajda karo kyunke tum se aik lamha pehle Imam takbeer kehta aur sajda o rafa karta hai aur tum aik lamha baad ye aamaal karo to tum us ke saath raho ge aur Imam jab tashahhud mein baithay to tum mein se har aik ye dua padhay ” zubaani badani aur maali ibadatein tamam ki tamam Allah ke liye hain Ae Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Aap par salam aur Allah ki rehmat ho aur us ki barkatein hun ham par bhi salam ho aur Allah ke naik bandon par bhi salam ho mein gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laiq nahi aur mein gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Allah ke banday aur us ke Rasool hain “ (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) "
"305","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamein tashahhud us tarah sikhaya kartay thay jis tarah Quran Kareem ki surtein sikhatay thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmaya kartay thay ke ” zubaani ibadatein jo barkat wali hain aur badani ibadatein aur maali ibadatein tamam ki tamam Allah ke liye hain Ae Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Aap par salam ho aur Allah ki rehmat ho aur us ki barkatein hun ham par bhi salam ho aur Allah ke naik bandon par bhi salam ho mein gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laiq nahi aur mein gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Allah ke banday aur us ke Rasool hain “ (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur bin Rumh ki riwayat mein hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (tashahhud) Quran Kareem ki tarah sikhaya kartay thay "
"306","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz mein ye dua maango ke ” Ae Allah mein teri panah maangta hun qabr ke azaab se aur mein teri panah maangta hun Dajjal ke fitnay se aur teri panah maangta hun zindagi aur maut ke fitnay se aur mein teri panah maangta hun gunah aur qarzdaari se aik shakhs bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap aksar qarzdaari se kyun panah maango hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab aadmi qarz daar hota hai to jhoot bolta hai aur waada khilafi karta hai "
"307","[AI-translation] ´Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mujhe aik dua sikhlaaiye jisay mein apni namaz mein padha karun to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye kaha kar ke ” Ae Allah ! mein ne apne nafs par bara zulm kiya hai ya bohat zulm kiya hai aur gunaahon ko siwa tere koi nahi bakhshta pas to bakhsh de mujhe apne paas ki bakhshish se aur mujh par rehem kar beshak to bakhshnay wala meharban hai “ "
"308","[AI-translation] ´Abud Darda (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (namaz ke liye) kharay hue to ham ne suna ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kehtay thay ke ” mein tujh se Allah ki panah maangta hun “ phir farmaya ke ” mein tujh par lanat karta hun jaisi Allah ne tujh par lanat ki “ (teen dafa farmaya) aur apna haath yun barhaya jaisay koi cheez letay hain jab namaz se farigh hue to ham ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! aaj ham ne namaz mein Aap ko wo baatein kartay suna jo pehle kabhi nahi suni thin aur ham ne ye bhi dekha ke Aap ne apna haath barhaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah ka dushman Iblees mera munh Jalanay ke liye angaray ka aik sho'la le kar aaya mein ne teen baar kaha ke mein tujh se Allah ki panah maangta hun phir mein ne kaha ke mein tujh par lanat karta hun jaisi Allah ne tujh par lanat ki poori lanat wo teenon baar peechay na hata aakhir mein ne chaha ke us ko pakar lun Allah ki qasam agar hamaray bhai Sulaiman alaihissalam ki dua na hoti to wo subah tak bandha rehta aur muddinay ke bachay us se kheltay "
"309","[AI-translation] ´Abu Mas'ud Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham log Sa'd bin Ubada raziyallahu anhu ke paas baithay hue thay ke itnay mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye Chunanche Bashir bin Sa'd raziyallahu anhu ne poocha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Allah ne hamein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par durood bhejnay ka hukm diya hai us liye bataiye ke ham Aap par kis tarah durood bhejein ye sun-nay ke baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bilkul khamosh rahay aur ham ne tumna ki Kaash unhon ne (Bashir raziyallahu anhu se) poocha hota phir thori dair baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us tarah durood padha karo ” Allahumma sallallahu Ali Muhammad wa 'ala aal Muhammad kama sallait Ali Ibrahim wa 'ala aal Ibrahim wa baarik Ali Muhammad o Ali aal Muhammad kama baarakt Ali Ibrahim o Ali aal Ibrahim fi Aalameen innak Humaid Majeed “ aur salam bhejnay ka tareeqa tumhein maloom hi hai "
"310","[AI-translation] ´Amir bin Sa'd apne walid Sa'd raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko daayein aur baayein taraf salam phertay dekha karta tha yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke rukhsaar ki safedi mujhe dikhayi deti "
"311","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` jab ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz padhtay to namaz ke ikhtitaam par daayein baayein salam alaikum wa rehmatullah Allah kehtay hue haath se ishara bhi kartay thay to (ye dekh kar) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum log apne haath se us tarah ishara kartay ho jaisay shareer ghoron ki damein hilti hain tumhein yehi kaafi hai ke tum qa'da mein apni raanon par haath rakhay hue daayein aur baayein munh mor kar salam alaikum wa rehmatullah Allah kaha karo "
"312","[AI-translation] ´Warraad jo Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) ke maula thay kehtay hain ke` Mughira raziyallahu anhu ne Muawiya raziyallahu anhu ko likh kar bheja ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab namaz padh chuktay aur salam phertay to kehtay ” koi sacha mabood nahi siwae Allah ke wo akeela hai aur us ka koi shareek nahi saltanat usi ki hai aur usi ki tareef hai aur wo sab kuch kar sakta hai ya Allah jo to de usay koi rok nahi sakta aur jo to na de usay koi de nahi sakta aur kisi koshish karnay walay ki koshish tere aagay faida nahi deti “ "
"313","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki namaz ka ikhtitaam pehchantay thay jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Allah Akbar kehtay "
"314","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs har namaz ke baad ((SubhanAllah Allah)) 33 baar aur ((Alhamdulillah)) 33 baar aur ((Allah Akbar)) 33 baar kahay to ye ninanway kalimay hun ge aur pooray 100 yun karay ke aik baar yun padhay ((” La ilaha illallah wahdahu la shareeka lahu lahul mulk wa lahul hamd wa huwa ala kulli shayin qadeer “)) yani ” Allah ke siwa koi ibadat ke laiq nahi wo akeela hai us ka koi shareek nahi usi ki saltanat hai aur usi ke liye sab tareef hai aur wo har cheez par qaadir hai “ to us ke gunah bakhshay jatay hain agarchay darya ke jhaag ke barabar (yani behad) hun "
"315","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` tum mein se koi apni zaat mein se shaitaan ko hissa na de ye na samjhay ke namaz ke baad daahni hi taraf phirna mujh par wajib hai mein ne aksar dekha hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baayein taraf bhi phirtay thay "
"316","[AI-translation] ´Abu Mas'ud Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qaum ki imamat wo shakhs karay jo Quran zyada janta ho agar Quran mein barabar hun to jo sunnat zyada janta ho agar sunnat mein sab barabar hun to jis ne pehle hijrat ki ho agar hijrat mein bhi sab barabar hun to jo Islam pehle laya ho aur kisi ki hukumat ki jagah mein ja kar us ki imamat na karay (yani muqarrar shuda Imam ke hotay hue us ki ijazat ke baghair imamat na karaye) aur na us ke ghar mein us ki masnad par baithay magar us ki ijazat se "
"317","[AI-translation] ´Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz padhtay thay jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ruku kartay to (sahaba) bhi ruku kartay thay aur jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ruku se sar uthatay to ((sami Allah liman hamidah)) kehtay aur ham kharay rehtay yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko zameen par peshani rakhtay dekhtay us waqt ham bhi sajda mein jatay "
"318","[AI-translation] ´Abu Mas'ud Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aik shakhs Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur arz kiya ke mein falan shakhs ki wajah se subah ki jamaat mein nahi aata kyunke wo qiraat lambi karta hai to mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko nasihat karnay mein kabhi itnay ghussay mein nahi dekha jitna us din dekha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae logon ! tum mein se baaz log aisay hain jo deen se mutanaffir karein jo koi tum mein se imamat karay to mukhtasar namaz padhay us liye ke us ke peechay boorha aur kamzor aur kaam wala hota hai "
"319","[AI-translation] ´Ubaidullah bin Abdullah kehtay hain ke` mein Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ki khidmat mein haazir hua aur arz kiya ke Aap mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki beemari ke waaqiaat bataiye unhon ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam beemar hue to poocha ke kiya log namaz padh chukay ham ne kaha ke nahi balke wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke muntazir hain irshaad farmaya ke hamaray liye bartan mein pani rakho ham ne pani rakha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ghusl farmaya us ke baad chalna chaha lekin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ghash aa gaya aur jab ifaaqa hua to phir poocha ke kiya log namaz padh chukay ham ne kaha ke nahi Ae Allah ke Rasool ! balke wo Aap ke muntazir hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke hamaray liye tasht (thaal) mein pani rakho Chunanche ham ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke hukm ki ta'meel ki aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ghusl kiya phir Aap chalnay ke liye tayyar hue lekin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dobara ghash aa gaya aur phir hosh mein aanay ke baad poocha ke kiya log namaz padh chukay ham ne arz kiya ke nahi Ae Allah ke Rasool ! wo sab log Aap ka intezar kar rahay hain aur idhar logon ki haalat ye thi ke wo sab namaz Isha ke liye risalat ma'aab sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki tashreef aawari ke masjid mein muntazir thay aakhir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik aadmi ke haath Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ko kehla bheja ke Aap namaz padhayein Chunanche us aadmi ne Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ki khidmat mein haazir ho kar kaha ke rehmat do aalim sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hukm diya hai ke Aap logon ko namaz padhayein Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu nihayat narm dil thay (wo jald ronay lagtay thay) us liye unhon ne Umar raziyallahu anhu se kaha ke Ae Umar ! tum namaz padha do jis par Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke nahi Aap hi imamat ke zyada mustahiq hain aur Aap hi ko namaz padhanay ke liye hukm diya gaya hai Chunanche Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ne kai din tak namaz padhayi usi dauran aik din Rasool-e-Akram sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki tabeeyat zara halki hui to Aap do aadmiyon ka sahaara le kar namaz Zohar ke liye masjid mein tashreef le gaye un do aadmiyon mein se aik Abbas raziyallahu anhu thay (jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke chacha thay) gharzike Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam masjid mein us waqt pahunche jab Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu bahaasiyat Imam namaz padha rahay thay unhon ne jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha to peechay hatna chaha lekin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ishara se farmaya ke peechay na hato aur apne saath walon se kaha ke mujhe Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ke barabar mein bitha do Chunanche un donon ne Aap ko Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ke barabar bitha diya risalat ma'aab sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baithay baithay namaz padhnay lagay aur Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu waisay hi kharay kharay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki namaz mein pairwi karnay lagay goya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Imam thay aur Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu muqtadi aur tamam sahaba kiraam hasab saabiq us farz namaz Zohar mein Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ki pairwi kar rahay thay Ubaidullah bin Abdullah ka bayan hai ke mein ne Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas ja kar kaha ke mein Aap ko wo hadees sunata hun jo Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne mujhe sunayi hai aur un ki talab pe mein ne poori hadees un se keh sunayi jisay sun-nay ke baad unhon ne kaha ke ye poori hadees bilkul sahih hai phir poocha ke doosray shakhs jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thay kiya un ka naam Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne nahi bataya mein ne jawab diya ke ji nahi to unhon ne kaha ke doosray aadmi Ali (raziyallahu anhu) thay "
"320","[AI-translation] ´Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath jang Tabook mein shirkat ki aik subah qabal namaz Fajr usi muqaam Tabook mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam rafa haajat ke liye rawana hue aur mein pani ka lota liye hue Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath tha rafa haajat ke baad jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye to mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke haathon par pani daalnay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne pehle teen martaba haath dhoye phir munh dhoya jubba ko baazuon par charhana chaha lekin us ki aasteenein tang thin us liye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jubba ke neechay se apne donon haath nikaal kar kohniyon tak dhoye aur us ke baad mozon par masah kiya phir mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath rawana hua jab ham wahan pahunche to dekha ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf raziyallahu anhu namaz padha rahay hain Chunanche un ke peechay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik rakat padhi Abdur Rahman bin Auf raziyallahu anhu ne donon rakatein padhnay ke baad salam pher ke dekha to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz poori karnay ki khaatir doosri rakat ke liye kharay ho gaye thay Musalman ye dekh kar ghabra gaye aur unhon ne bakasrat tasbeeh padhi phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne baad faraaghat namaz farmaya ke tum logon ne acha kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us par khushi ka izhaar kiya ke logon ne waqt par namaz ada ki "
"321","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aik nabina shakhs aaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! mujhe koi pakar kar masjid tak lanay wala nahi aur us ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ghar mein namaz padhnay ke liye rukhsat chaahi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne usay ijazat de phir jab laut gaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bila kar poocha ke kiya tum azaan suntay ho us ne arz kiya ke haan to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum masjid mein aaya karo "
"322","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jamaat ki namaz akelay shakhs ki namaz se pachees darjay barh kar hai "
"323","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` ham khayal kartay thay ke (Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ehad mein) namaz ba-jamaat se wohi munafiq peechay rehta tha jis ka nifaaq zaahir ho ya phir beemar aadmi aur beemar aadmi bhi do aadmiyon ke kandhon par haath rakh kar (aa sakta) to aata aur namaz mein milta tha aur unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein deen aur hidayat ki baatein sikhayein aur unhi hidayat ki baaton mein se hai ke aisi masjid mein namaz padhna jis mein azaan hoti ho "
"324","[AI-translation] ´Abdur Rahman bin Abu Umra kehtay hain ke` Usman bin Affan raziyallahu anhu Maghrib ke baad masjid mein aaye aur akelay baith gaye mein un ke paas ja baitha unhon ne kaha ke Ae mere bhatijay ! mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jis ne Isha ki namaz jamaat se padhi to goya aadhi raat tak nafl padhta raha (yani aisa sawab paye ga) aur jis ne subah ki namaz jamaat se padhi wo goya saari raat namaz padhta raha "
"325","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke namaz Isha aur Fajr munafiqon par bohat bhaari hain agar us ka ajar jantay to ghutnon ke bal chal kar aatay aur mein ne to irada kiya ke namaz ka hukm dun ke (jamaat) namaz khari ki jaye aur aik shakhs ko kahun ke logon ko namaz padhaye aur chand logon ke saath aik dhair lakrion ka le kar un logon ke paas jaun jo log namaz mein nahi aaye aur un ke gharon ko jala dun aur aik doosri riwayat mein itna zyada hai ke agar koi shakhs aik haddi farba janwar ki paye to zaroor aaye (yani namaz ko) "
"326","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo log Juma mein haazir nahi hotay un ke haq mein irada karta hun ke hukm karun aik shakhs ko jo logon ko namaz padhaye phir mein un logon ke gharon ko jala dun jo Juma mein nahi aaye "
"327","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik din namaz padhanay ke baad farmaya ke Ae falan ! tum apni namaz achi tarah kyun ada nahi kartay kiya namazi ko ye dikhayi nahi deta ke wo kis tarah namaz padh raha hai halanke wo apne faiday ke liye namaz padhta hai aur Allah ki qasam mein peechay walon ko bhi usi tarah dekhta hun jis tarah apne aagay walon ko dekhta hun "
"328","[AI-translation] ´Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki namaz ko jaancha to maloom hua ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka qayaam phir ruku phir ruku se khara hona phir sajda aur donon sajdon ke darmiyan ka jalsa phir doosra sajda aur sajday aur salam ke baich ka jalsa ye sab taqreeban barabar thay "
"329","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` beshak mein tumharay saath us tarah namaz padhnay mein kotaahi nahi karta jis tarah Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamaray saath padhtay thay (saabit ne) kaha ke Anas (raziyallahu anhu) aik kaam kartay thay mein tumhein wo kaam kartay hue nahi dekhta ke jab wo ruku se sar uthatay to seedhay kharay hotay yahan tak ke kehnay wala kehta ke wo bhool gaye aur jab sajda se sar uthatay to itna thehartay ke kehnay wala kehta ke wo bhool gaye (yani dair tak thehray rehtay) "
"330","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya hai ke namazon mein behtar wo namaz hai jis mein dair tak khara rehna ho "
"331","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamaray paas tashreef laaye aur farmaya ke mein tumhein us tarah haath uthatay dekh raha hun goya wo shareer ghoron ki damein hain tum log namaz mein sukoon se raha karo phir aik martaba Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein halqa baandhay dekh kar farmaya ke tum log alag alag kyun ho phir aik martaba farmaya ke tum log us tarah saf kyun nahi baandhtay jis tarah baargaah ilaahi mein farishtay saf baandhay hain ham ne arz kiya Ae Allah ke Rasool ! farishtay apne Rab ke haan kis tarah saf baandhtay hain to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo pehli safon ko poora kartay hain aur saf mein mil kar kharay hotay hain "
"332","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe kisi kaam ke liye bheja phir mein laut kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas pahuncha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (sawaari par) chal rahay thay Qutaiba ne kaha ke (nafl) namaz padh rahay thay mein ne salam kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ishaaray se jawab diya jab namaz se farigh hue to mujhe bulaya aur farmaya ke to ne abhi mujhe salam kiya tha aur mein namaz padh raha tha (us liye jawab na de saka) halanke Aap ka munh mashriq ki taraf tha (aur qibla mashriq ki taraf na tha to maloom hua ke nafl namaz sawaari par padhtay waqt qibla ki taraf munh hona zaroori nahi) "
"333","[AI-translation] ´Muawiya bin hukm Salmi raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz padh raha tha ke itnay mein ham mein se aik shakhs chheenka to mein ne kaha ke yarhamuk Allah to logon ne mujhe ghoorna shuru kar diya mein ne kaha ke Kaash mujh par meri maan ro chuki hoti (yani mein mar jata) tum kyun mujhe ghoortay ho ye sun kar wo log apne haath raanon par maarnay lagay jab mein ne ye dekha ke wo mujhe chup karana chahtay hain to mein chup ho raha jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz padh chukay to qurban hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par mere maan baap ke mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se pehle aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baad koi Aap se behtar sikhanay wala nahi dekha Allah ki qasam Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne na mujhe maara aur na mujhe gaali di balke yun farmaya ke namaz mein duniya ki baatein karna durust nahi wo to tasbeeh takbeer aur Quran Majeed ka padhna hai ya jaisa ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mera jahiliyat ka zamana abhi guzra hai ab Allah Taala ne Islam naseeb kiya hai ham mein se baaz log kahinon (panditon najoomiyon) ke paas jatay hain to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to un ke paas mat ja phir mein ne kaha ke ham mein se baaz bura shagoon letay hain to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye un ke dilon ki baat hai to kisi kaam se un ko na rokay ya tum ko na rokay phir mein ne kaha ke ham mein se baaz log lakeerein kheenchtay hain (yani kaaghaz par ya zameen par jaisay rammaal kiya kartay hain) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aik paighambar lakeerein khaincha kartay thay phir jo waisi hi lakeer karay to wo durust hai Muawiya raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke meri aik londi thi jo Uhud aur jawanya (aik muqaam ka naam hai) ki taraf bakriyan charaaya karti thi aik din mein jo wahan aa nikla to dekha ke bheerya aik bakri ko le gaya hai aakhir mein bhi aadmi hun mujhe bhi ghussa aa jata hai jaisay un ko aata hai mein ne us ko aik tamaacha maara phir mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mera ye fail bohat bara qarar diya mein ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kiya mein us londi ko azaad na kar dun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko mere paas le kar aa mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas le kar gaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se poocha ke Allah kahan hai us ne kaha ke aasmaan par phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein kaun hun us ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Allah ke Rasool hain (yani Allah ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko bheja hai) to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to us ko azaad kar de ye momina (yani imandaar) hai "
"334","[AI-translation] ´Zaid bin Arqam raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` ham log namaz mein baatein kiya kartay thay har shakhs apne paas walay se namaz padhtay padhtay baat karta tha yahan tak ke ye aayat ” Allah ke saamnay chup chaap (farmanbardaar ho kar) kharay ho “ naazil hui tab se hamein khamosh rehnay ka hukm hua aur baat karna mana ho gaya "
"335","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mardon ko SubhanAllah Allah kehna chahiye aur auraton ko taali bajaani chahiye aur aik riwayat mein hai ke (aisa) namaz mein (karna chahiye) "
"336","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ya to log namaz mein dua kartay waqt apni nigaah ko aasmaan ki taraf uthanay se ruk jayein ya phir un ki nigaahein chheen li jayein gi "
"337","[AI-translation] ´Busr bin Sa'eed se riwayat hai ke` Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) ne un ko Abu Juhaim (Abdullah bin Haris bin Summa Ansari raziyallahu anhu) ke paas ye poochnay ke liye bheja ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us shakhs ke baaray mein kiya farmaya hai jo namazi ke saamnay se guzray Abu Juhaim raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya hai ke agar namazi ke saamnay se guzarnay wala wo wabaal (jo us ke guzarnay ki wajah se us par hai) jaan le to chaalees tak khara rehna saamnay se guzarnay se behtar samjhay Abu Nasr ne kaha ke mein nahi janta hai ke (Abu Juhaim raziyallahu anhu ne) kiya kaha chaalees din ya maheena ya chaalees saal "
"338","[AI-translation] ´Abu Saalih as-Sammaan kehtay hain ke` mein Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath tha wo Juma ke din kisi cheez ki aar mein logon se alag ho kar namaz padh rahay thay itnay mein Abu Muait ki qaum ka aik jawan aaya aur us ne un ke saamnay se nikalna chaha Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) ne us ke seena mein maara us ne dekha to aur taraf rasta na paya aur phir dobara un ke saamnay se nikalna chaha Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) ne aur zor se aik maar maari wo seedha khara ho gaya aur Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) se larnay laga phir logon ne us ko aa kar roka phir wo nikla aur Marwan (jo Madina ka haakim tha) ke paas ja kar shikayat ki (rawi ne) kaha Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) Marwan ke paas gaye to Marwan ne kaha ke to ne kiya kiya jo tere bhai ka beta shikayat karta hai Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jab koi tum mein se kisi cheez ki aar mein namaz padhay aur koi shakhs us ke saamnay se nikalna chahay to us ke seena par maaray agar wo na manay to us se laray kyunke wo shaitaan hai "
"339","[AI-translation] ´Talha bin Ubaidullah raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` ham namaz padhtay thay aur janwar hamaray saamnay se guzra kartay thay to ham ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se us ka zikr kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar paalaan ki pichli lakri ke barabar koi cheez tumharay saamnay ho to phir saamnay se kisi cheez ka guzar jana nuqsan nahi karta "
"340","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab Eid ke din bahar nikaltay to apne saamnay barchha gaarnay ka hukm detay phir us ki aar mein namaz padhtay aur log Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay hotay aur ye kaam safar mein kartay thay usi wajah se ameeron ne us ko muqarrar kar liya hai (ke barchha saath rakhtay hain) "
"341","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni oontni ko qibla ki taraf kar ke us ki taraf namaz padhtay thay "
"342","[AI-translation] ´Aun bin Abu Hujaifa se riwayat hai ke` un ke walid Abu Juhaifa raziyallahu anhu ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko chamray ke surkh khaimay mein dekha aur mein ne Bilal raziyallahu anhu ko dekha ke unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke wuzu ka bacha hua pani nikala to log us ko lenay ke liye jhapatnay lagay phir jis ko pani mil gaya us ne apne badan par mil liya aur jis ko na mila us ne (apna haath) apne saathi ke haath se tar kar liya phir mein ne Bilal raziyallahu anhu ko dekha ke unhon ne barchha nikala aur us ko gaara aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam surkh jora pehnay hue us ko (pindlion tak) uthaye hue niklay aur barchhay ki taraf kharay ho kar logon ko do rakat namaz padhayi aur mein ne aadmiyon aur janwaron ko dekha ke wo barchhay ke saamnay se guzar rahay thay "
"343","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kamar par haath rakh kar namaz padhnay se mana farmaya "
"344","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne masjid mein qabale ki taraf thook dekha to logon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya ke tumhara kiya haal hai ke tum mein se koi apne Rab ki taraf munh kar ke khara hota hai phir apne saamnay thookta hai kiya tum mein se koi us baat ko pasand karta hai ke koi us ki taraf munh karay aur phir us ke saamnay thook de jab tum mein se kisi ko thoo aaye to baayein taraf qadam ke neechay thookay agar jagah na ho to aisa karay (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye amal kar ke dukhaya) Qaasim ne (jo ke us hadees ka rawi hai) yun bayan kiya ke apne kapray mein thooka phir usi kapray ko mil daalnay "
"345","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se kisi ko namaz mein jamayi aaye to jahan tak ho sakay us ko rokay us liye ke shaitaan (dil mein waswasa daalnay aur namaz ko bhalanay ke liye) andar ghusta hai aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke (jamayi letay waqt) apna haath apne munh par rakhay us liye ke shaitaan (makkhi ya keeray waghera ki shakal mein baaz auqaat) andar ghus jata hai (ya darhaqeeqat shaitaan ghusta hai aur yehi sahih hai) "
"346","[AI-translation] ´Abu Qatada Ansari raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko logon ki imamat kartay hue dekha aur Umaama bint Abul Aas raziyallahu anhu Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki Nawwaasi Aap ke kandhay par thin (ye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sahabzadi Zainab raziyallahu anha ki beti thin) jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ruku kartay to un ko bitha detay aur jab sajda se kharay hotay to phir un ko kandhay par bitha letay "
"347","[AI-translation] ´Mu'aiqib raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sajda ki jagah par maujood kankariyon ko barabar karnay ke baaray mein farmaya ke agar zaroorat paray to aik baar karay "
"348","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin ash-Shakheer raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz padhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne thooka phir zameen par apni jootay se masal daalnay "
"349","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Abdullah bin Haris ko dekha ke wo jora baandhay hue namaz padh rahay thay to Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) un ke jore kholnay lagay jab wo namaz se farigh hue to poocha ke tum ne mera sar kyun chhua Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jo shakhs baalon ka jora baandh kar namaz padhay us ki misaal aisi hai jaisay koi satr khol kar namaz padhay "
"350","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab namaz qareeb aaye aur khana bhi saamnay aa jaye to Maghrib ki namaz se pehle khana kha lo aur khana chhor kar namaz ki taraf jaldi na karo (us liye ke khanay ki taraf dil laga rahay ga aur us ke ilawa aur bhi hikmatein hain) "
"351","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi apni namaz mein shak karay (ke kitni rakatein padhi hain) aur maloom na ho sakay ke teen padhi hain ya chaar to shak ko door karay aur jis qadar ka yaqeen ho us ko qaim karay phir salam se pehle do sajday kar le ab agar us ne paanch rakatein padhi hain to ye do sajday mil kar chhe rakatein ho jayein gi aur agar poori chaar padhi hain to un donon sajdon se shaitaan ke munh mein khaak par jaye gi "
"352","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein Zohar ya Asr ki namaz padhayi aur do rakatein padh kar salam pher diya phir aik lakri ke paas aaye jo masjid mein qibla ki taraf lagi hui thi aur us par tek laga kar ghussa mein kharay ho gaye us waqt jamaat mein Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu aur Umar Farooq raziyallahu anhu bhi maujood thay wo donon darr ki wajah se baat na kar sakay aur jaldi walay log ye kehtay hue niklay ke namaz kam ho gayi phir aik shakhs jis ko Zul-Yadain (do haath wala agarchay sab ke do haath hotay hain lekin us ke haath lambay thay us liye ye naam ho gaya) kehtay thay khara hua aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kiya namaz ghat (kam) gayi ya Aap bhool gaye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye sun kar daayein aur baayein dekha aur farmaya ke Zul-Yadain kiya kehta hai logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wo sach kehta hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne do hi rakatein padhi hain ye sun kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne do rakatein aur padhein aur salam phera phir takbeer kahi aur sajda kiya phir takbeer kahi aur sar uthaya phir takbeer kahi aur sajda kiya phir takbeer kahi aur sar uthaya (Muhammad bin Sireen) ne kaha ke mujhe Imran bin Husain ne ye bayan kiya aur kaha ke aur (aakhir mein) salam phera "
"353","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Quran padhtay thay to jab wo surat padhtay jis mein sajda ki aayat hoti to sajda kartay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath jo log hotay wo bhi sajda kartay yahan tak ke ham mein se baazon ko apni peshani rakhnay ki jagah na milti thi "
"354","[AI-translation] ´Abu Raafe raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath Isha ki namaz padhi aur us mein ” iza as-sama inshaqqat “ (surat) tilawat ki aur us mein sajda kiya (namaz ke baad) mein ne kaha ke ye sajda tum ne kaisa kiya unhon ne kaha ke mein ne to ye sajda Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay kiya hai aur mein us ko karta rahun ga yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se milon (yani taahayaat karta rahun ga)"
"355","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab namaz Fajr ki qiraat se farigh ho jatay to (doosri rakat mein) sar mubarak ruku se uthatay aur farmatay ke ” sami Allah liman hamidah Ae hamaray Rab ! sab tareef tere hi liye hai “ phir kharay hi kharay kehtay ke ” Ae Allah ! Waleed bin Waleed Salama bin Hisham ko aur Ayyaash bin Abu Rabia ko (ye sab Musalman kuffaar ke haathon mein thay) aur mominon mein se zaeef logon (yani jo Makka walon ke haath mein dabe paray thay) ko nijaat de ya Allah (qabeela) Muzar par apni pakar sakht kar aur un par Yusuf alaihissalam ke zamana ki tarah ka qaht daal de (jaisay Misr mein saat baras waaqe hua tha) ya Allah lanat kar Lihyaan Ri'l Zakwaan aur Usayya par (jinhon ne Allah aur us ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki nafarmani ki) phir hamein khabar pahunchi ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye baddua chhor di jab ye aayat naazil ke ” Ae Nabi ! tum ko us kaam mein kuch ikhtiyar nahi hai Allah Taala chahay to un ki tauba qabool karay aur chahay to unhein azaab karay kyunke wo zaalim hain “ "
"356","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay thay ke` mein tumhein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki namaz ke qareeb namaz padhaon ga phir Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Zohar Isha aur Fajr mein qunoot padhtay thay aur mominon ke liye dua kartay thay aur kafiron par lanat kartay thay "
"357","[AI-translation] ´Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam subah aur Maghrib ki namaz mein qunoot padhtay thay "
"358","[AI-translation] ´Umm ul-Momineen Hafsa raziyallahu anha kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab Fajr nikal aati to halki halki do rakaton (yani sunnat Fajr) ke ilawa kuch na padhtay thay "
"359","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat karti hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Fajr ki do rakatein duniya aur jo kuch (us) duniya mein hai (un sab se) behtar hain "
"360","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne subah ki sunnaton mein Qul ya ayyuha al-kaafiroon aur Qul Huwallahu Ahad padhi "
"361","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Fajr ki sunnat padh chuktay to mein agar jaagti hoti to mujh se baatein kartay warna lait jatay "
"362","[AI-translation] ´Simaak bin Harb kehtay hain ke mein ne Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke` kiya tum Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas baithtay thay unhon ne kaha ke haan bohat phir kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aadat aadat-e-mubarak thi ke apni namaz ki jagah baithay rehtay subah ke baad jab tak ke aaftab na nikalta phir jab sooraj nikalta to uth kharay hotay aur log door jahiliyat ka zikr kiya kartay thay aur hanstay thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam muskuratay rehtay thay "
"363","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko kabhi chasht ki namaz padhtay nahi dekha aur mein padha karti hun aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baaz kaam pasand kartay thay magar us khauf se na kartay thay ke agar log karnay lagein ge to kahein farz na ho jaye "
"364","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab aadmi par subah hoti hai to us ke har jor par aik sadqa wajib hota hai phir aik martaba SubhanAllah Allah kehna sadqa hai aik martaba Alhamdulillah kehna sadqa hai aur aik martaba ” la ilaah illa Allah “ padhna sadqa hai aur aik martaba ” Allah Akbar “ kehna sadqa hai aur achi baat ka hukm karna sadqa hai aur buri baat se rokna sadqa hai aur chasht ki do rakat namaz padh lena un tamam umoor se kifayat kar jata hai "
"365","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chasht ki namaz ki chaar rakatein padha kartay thay aur jo Allah chahta zyada bhi kar liya kartay thay "
"366","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Haris bin Naufal kehtay hain ke` mein aarzu rakhta aur poochta phirta tha ke koi mujhe bataye ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne chasht ki namaz padhi hai to mein ne kisi ko na paya jo ke mujh se ye bayan karay siwae Umm Hani raziyallahu anha ke Umm Hani raziyallahu anha jo Abu Talib ki beti hain unhon ne khabar di ke fatah Makka ke din Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam din charhe aaye kapray ka aik parda Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye daal diya gaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ghusl farmaya phir kharay ho kar aath rakat namaz padhi mein nahi jaanti thi ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka qayaam lamba tha ya ruku ya sajda (taqreeban) sab barabar barabar thay aur mein ne us se pehle aur baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko chasht padhtay nahi dekha "
"367","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mere dost (Muhammad Rasoolullah ! sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe teen cheezon ki wasiyat farmayi 1 har maheena mein teen rozon ki 2 chasht ki do rakat ki 3 aur sonay se pehle witr padh lenay ki "
"368","[AI-translation] ´Qaasim Shaibaani se riwayat hai ke` Zaid bin Arqam raziyallahu anhu ne kuch logon ko dekha ke wo chasht ke waqt mein namaz padh rahay thay to farmaya : ye log khoob jantay hain ke namaz us waqt ke ilawa doosray waqt mein afzal hai Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ” namaz awwaabeen “ us waqt hoti hai jab ke oontni ke bachon ke paon Jalnay lagein (yani sooraj buland ho kar garmi paida kar de) "
"369","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab aadmi sajda ki aayat padhta hai aur phir sajda karta hai to shaitaan rota hua aik taraf chala jata hai aur kehta hai ke kharaabi ho us ki ya meri aadmi ko sajda ka hukm hua aur us ne sajda kiya ab us ko jannat milay gi aur mujhe sajda ka hukm hua aur mein ne inkar kiya ab mere liye jahannam hai "
"370","[AI-translation] ´Umm ul-Momineen Umm Habiba raziyallahu anha ne` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ye farmatay hue suna ke koi Musalman banda aisa nahi ke Allah Taala ke wastay har din mein baara rakat sunnatein khushi se padhay siwa farz ke magar Allah Taala us ke wastay aik ghar jannat mein banata hai ya ye farmaya ke us ke liye aik ghar jannat mein banaya jata hai Umm ul-Momineen Umm Habiba raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke mein us din se hamesha padhti hun aur Amr (yani bin Aus) ne kaha ke mein bhi us din se hamesha padhta hun aur Numan (yani bin Salim) ne bhi aisa hi kaha aur aik riwayat mein hai ke ” aik din aur raat mein baara rakat “ "
"371","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mughaffal al-Muzani raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : har do azaanon ke maabain namaz hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye baat teen martaba irshaad farmayi teesri baar farmaya jo chahay padh le "
"372","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Zohar se pehle do rakatein aur Zohar ke baad do rakat (sunnat) padhein aur Maghrib ke baad do rakatein aur Isha ke baad do rakatein aur Juma ke baad do rakatein padhein lekin Maghrib Isha aur Juma ki do do rakatein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath ghar mein padhein "
"373","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Shaffeeq raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki nafl namaz ka haal poocha to unhon ne farmaya : Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mere ghar mein Zohar se pehle chaar rakat namaz padhtay thay phir nikaltay aur logon ke saath farz namaz padhtay phir ghar mein aa kar do rakat padhtay aur logon ke saath Maghrib ki namaz padhtay phir ghar mein aa kar do rakat padhtay aur Isha ki namaz logon ke saath padhtay aur ghar mein aa kar do rakat padhtay aur raat ko no rakat padhtay ke usi mein witr hota aur bari raat tak kharay ho kar padhtay aur bari raat tak baith kar jab kharay ho kar qiraat kartay to ruku aur sajda bhi kharay ho kar kartay aur jab qiraat baith kar kartay to sajda aur ruku bhi baith kar kartay aur jab Fajr nikalti to do rakat padhtay "
"374","[AI-translation] ´Zaid bin Sabit (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne khajoor ke patton waghera ka ya boriye ka aik hujra banaya aur aa kar us mein namaz padhnay lagay bohat se sahaba kiraam aaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki iqtida mein namaz padhnay lagay Zaid bin Sabit kehtay hain : phir aik raat bohat se sahaba aaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne dair ki aur un ki taraf na niklay aur logon ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf aawazein buland kein aur darwaza par kankariyan maarein to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ki taraf ghussa se niklay aur un se farmaya ke tumhari ye haalat aisi hi rehti to mujhe gumaan ho gaya tha ke ye namaz bhi tum par farz ho jaye gi tum apne gharon mein namaz padho us liye ke siwae farz ke aadmi ki behtar namaz wohi hai jo ghar mein padhay (ke ye riya se door hai) aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne chataayi se masjid mein aik hujra banaya "
"375","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab koi shakhs apni masjid mein namaz padhay to kuch hissa apne ghar mein padhnay ke liye bacha kar rakhay (yani sunnat o nawaafil) us liye ke Allah Taala us ki namaz se us ke ghar mein behtari karay ga "
"376","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam masjid mein daakhil hue aur aik rassi do sutoonon ke darmiyan lataki hui dekhi to farmaya ke ye kiya hai logon ne arz kiya ke ye Umm ul-Momineen Zainab raziyallahu anha ki rassi hai aur wo namaz padhti rehti hain phir jab sust ho jati hain ya thak jati hain to us ko pakar leti hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko khol daalo chahiye ke tum mein se har aik apni khushi ke muwafiq namaz padhay phir jab sust ho jaye ya thak jaye to baith rahay "
"377","[AI-translation] ´Alqama kehtay hain ke mein ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se poocha ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ibadat ka kiya haal tha aaya kisi din ko ibadat ke liye khaas farmatay thay unhon ne kaha ke nahi balke un ki ibadat hamesha thi aur tum mein se kaun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki si ibadat kar sakta hai jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kar saktay thay "
"378","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki maujoodgi mein Haula bint Tuwait un ke paas se guzarein to mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se arz kiya ke ye Haula bint Tuwait hain aur log kehtay hain ke ye raat bhar nahi sauti (ibadat karti hain) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us qadar amal ikhtiyar karo jis qadar tumhein taqat ho aur qasam hai Allah ki ke tum thak jao ge aur Allah (ajar o sawab de kar) nahi thake ga "
"379","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` aik raat mein apni khala Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) ke paas raha (us liye ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki tahajjud ki namaz dekhein) aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam raat ko uthay aur apni qaza haajat ko gaye phir apna haath munh dhoya aur phir sau rahay phir uthay aur mushk ke paas aa kar us ka bandhan khola phir do wuzuon ke baich ka wuzu kiya (yani na bohat mubaalgha ka na bohat halka) aur zyada pani nahi giraya aur poora wuzu kiya phir kharay ho kar namaz padhni shuru ki aur mein bhi utha aur angraayi li ke kahein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ye na samajhein ke ye hamara haal dekhnay ke liye hoshiyaar tha (us se ye maloom hua ke sahaba ko Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath ilm ghaib ka aqeeda na tha jaisay ab jaahilon ko ambiya aur auliya ke saath hai) aur mein ne wuzu kiya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki baayein taraf khara ho gaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mera haath pakra aur ghuma kar apni daahni taraf khara kar liya (us se maloom hua ke aik muqtadi ho to Imam ki daahni taraf khara ho) gharz ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki namaz raat ko tehra rakat poori hui phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam lait rahay aur sau gaye yahan tak ke kharratay lenay lagay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aadat aadat-e-mubarak thi ke jab sau jatay thay to kharratay letay thay phir Bilal raziyallahu anhu aaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko subah ki namaz ke liye aagaah kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam uthay aur namaz (sunnat Fajr) ada ki aur wuzu nahi kiya aur un alfaaz se dua maangi ” Ae Allah mere dil mein noor paida kar de aur aankh mein noor aur kaan mein noor aur mere daayein noor aur mere baayein noor aur mere upar noor aur mere neechay noor aur mere aagay noor aur peechay noor aur barha de mere liye noor “ Kuraib (rawi hadees) ne kaha ke saat lafz aur farmaye thay ke wo mere dil mein hain (yani munh par nahi aatay us liye ke mein bhool gaya) phir mein ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ki baaz aulad se mulaqat ki to unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya ke wo alfaaz ye hain ” mera pattha aur mera gosht aur mera lahu aur mere baal aur meri khaal aur do cheezein aur zikr kein (yani un sab mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne noor maanga) "
"380","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab raat ko namaz shuru kartay to pehle do halki si rakatein padh letay "
"381","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab raat ko namaz ke liye kharay hotay to farmatay ke ” Ae Allah sab khoobiyan tere hi liye hain to aasmaan aur zameen ki roshani hai aur tujhi ko tareef hai to aasmaan aur zameen ka thaamnay wala hai tujhi ko tareef hai to aasmaan o zameen aur jo un mein hain sab ka paalnay wala hai to sacha hai tera waada sacha hai teri baat sachi hai teri mulaqat sachi hai jannat sach hai dozakh sach hai qayamat sach hai ya Allah mein teri baat maanta hun tujh par iman lata hun tujh par bharosa karta hun teri taraf jhukta hun tere saath ho kar auron se jhagarta hun aur tujh hi se faisla chahta hun sau to mere aglay pichlay chhupe khulay gunaahon ko bakhsh de ya Allah to hi mera mabood hai tere siwa koi mabood nahi “ "
"382","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam raat ko tehra rakat padhtay un mein se paanch witr hotein aur sirf aakhir mein baithay (yani paanch rakatein witr aik tashahhud se padhtay) "
"383","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` aik shakhs ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se raat ki namaz ke baaray mein poocha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : raat ki namaz do do rakat hai phir jab khayal ho ke subah ho chali to aik rakat padh le ke wo (aik rakat) us saari namaz ko jo us ne padhi witr kar de gi "
"384","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko raat ki namaz mein baith kar qiraat kartay hue nahi dekha phir jab boorhay ho gaye to baithay baithay qiraat kartay yahan tak ke jab surat ki tees ya chaalees aayaat reh jatin to kharay ho kar padhtay phir ruku kartay "
"385","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aik shakhs ka zikr kiya gaya ke wo subah tak sota hai (yani tahajjud ko nahi uthta) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ke kaan mein ya donon kaanon mein shaitaan peshaab kar jata hai "
"386","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se kisi ko namaz mein oongh aa jaye to chahiye ke sau rahay yahan tak ke us ki neend jati rahay us liye ke jab tum mein se koi oonghnay lagta hai to gumaan hai ke wo maghfirat maangnay ka irada karay aur apni jaan ko gaaliaan denay lagay "
"387","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se marfooan bayan kartay hain ke` tum mein se (jab koi sau jata hai) to shaitaan har aik ki gardan par teen girahein lagata hai har girah par phoonk deta hai ke abhi raat bohat hai phir jab koi jaaga aur us ne Allah ko yaad kiya to aik girah khul gayi aur jab wuzu kiya to do girahein khul gayein aur jab namaz padhi to sab girahein khul gayein phir wo subah ko hishaash bashaash khush mizaaj uthta hai aur nahi to ganda dil sust ho kar uthta hai "
"388","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay : raat mein aik ghari aisi hai ke us waqt jo Musalman aadmi Allah Taala se duniya o aakhirat ki bhalayi maangay Allah Taala us ko ataa karta hai aur ye (ghari) har raat mein hoti hai "
"389","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jab awwal tihayi raat guzar jati hai to Allah Taala har raat ko aasmaan duniya ki taraf utarta hai aur farmata : ” mein baadshah hun “ ” mein baadshah hun “ kaun hai jo mujh se dua karay ke mein qabool karun kaun hai jo mujh se maangay ke mein usay dun kaun hai jo mujh se maghfirat maangay ke mein usay bakhsh dun gharz ke subah roshan honay tak aisa hi farmata rehta hai "
"390","[AI-translation] ´Zaraara se riwayat hai ke` Sa'd bin Hisham bin Amir ne chaha ke Allah ki raah mein jihad karay aur Madina ko aaye aur Madina mein apni zameen aur baagh waghera farokht karein taake us se hathiyar aur ghoray khareedein aur Nasaara se martay dam tak larein phir jab Madina aaye aur Madina walon se milay to unhon ne un ko mana kiya (yani bilkul kaarobaar duniya aur zarooriyaat bashri chhor kar aisa na karna chahiye) aur khabar di ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki zindagi mein chhe aadmiyon ne us ka irada kiya tha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko mana kiya aur farmaya ke kiya tumharay liye meri raah achi nahi phir jab logon ne un se ye kaha to unhon ne apni biwi se jis ko talaqein de chukay thay gawahon ki maujoodgi mein rujoo kar liya phir wo Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas aaye aur un se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke witr ka haal poocha to unhon ne kaha ke mein tumhein aisa shakhs na bata dun ke jo saari zameen ke logon se zyada Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke witr ka haal behtar janta hai unhon ne kaha ke kaun hai Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke wo Aisha (raziyallahu anha) hain sau tum un ke paas jao un se poocho aur phir un ke jawab se mujhe bhi aa kar muttala kar dena phir mein (Sa'd bin Hisham) un ke paas se chala aur Hakeem bin Aflah ke paas aaya aur un se chaha ke wo mujhe Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas le chalein unhon ne kaha ke mein un ke paas nahi jata us liye ke mein ne unhein un donon girohon (yani sahaba ki aapas ki laraion) mein bolnay se mana kiya tha magar unhon ne na maana aur chali gayein (Sa'd bin Hisham ne) kaha ke mein ne Hakeem ko qasam di to wo tayyar ho gaye aur ham (donon) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ki taraf chalay aur unhein ittila ki to unhon ne ijazat de di aur ham un ki khidmat mein haazir hue tab unhon ne kaha ke kiya ye Hakeem hain unhon ne kaha haan gharz Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne unhein pehchan liya (yani aawaz waghera se parda ki aar se) phir unhon ne farmaya ke tumharay saath kaun hai Hakeem ne kaha ke mere saath Sa'd bin Hisham hain unhon ne kaha ke Hisham kaun se Hakeem ne kaha ke Amir ke betay tab un par rehmat ki dua ki aur Qatada ne kaha ke wo jang Uhud mein shaheed hue thay phir mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Umm ul-Momineen ! mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke akhlaaq ke baaray mein batlaiye unhon ne kaha ke kiya tum ne Quran nahi padha mein (Sa'd) ne kaha ke kyun nahi unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka akhlaaq Quran tha unhon ne kaha ke phir mein ne chalnay ka irada kiya aur chaha ke maut ke waqt tak ab kisi cheez ke baaray mein na poochon phir mujhe khayal aaya to mein ne arz kiya ke mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke raat ke waqt uthnay (aur namaz padhnay) ke baaray mein batlaiye to Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke kiya tum ne ya ayyuha al-Muzzammil nahi padhi mein ne kaha ke kyun nahi unhon ne kaha ke Allah Taala ne us surat ke shuru mein raat ko kharay ho kar (namaz) padhnay ko farz kiya phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahaba raat ko namaz padhtay rahay aur Allah Taala ne us surat ka khaatima (aakhri aayaat) baara maheena tak aasmaan par rokay rakha yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne us surat ka aakhir utara aur us mein takhfeef farmayi (yani tahajjud ki farziyat maaf kar di aur masnoon hona baaqi raha) phir raat ko namaz (tahajjud) padhna farz honay ke baad khushi ka sauda ho gaya (nafl ho gaya) phir mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Umm ul-Momineen ! mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke witr ke baaray mein bhi batlaiye to unhon ne kaha ke ham log Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye miswaak aur wuzu ka pani tayyar rakhtay thay aur Allah Taala Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko raat ko jab chahta utha deta tha phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam miswaak kartay thay aur wuzu kartay phir no rakat padhtay thay us mein na baithtay magar aathwin rakat mein baad aur Allah Taala ko yaad kartay aur us ki hamd o sana kartay aur dua kartay (yani tashahhud padhtay) phir salam na phertay aur kharay ho jatay aur noein rakat padhtay phir baithtay aur Allah ko yaad kartay aur us ki tareef kartay aur us se dua kartay aur us tarah salam phertay ke ham ko suna detay (taake sotay jaag uthein) phir salam ke baad baithay baithay do rakat padhtay gharz ye gyaara rakatein huein Ae mere betay ! phir jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka sun (Umar mubarak) zyada ho gaya aur badan mein gosht aa gaya to saat rakat witr padhnay lagay aur rakatein waisi hi padhtay jaisi pehle padhtay thay gharz ye sab no rakatein huein Ae mere betay (yani saat witr aur tahajjud aur do rakat witr ke baad) aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aadat thi ke jab koi namaz padhtay to us par hamaishgi kartay aur jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par neend ya kisi dard ka ghalba hota jis ki wajah se raat ko na uth saktay to din ko baara rakatein ada kartay (yani witr na padhtay us se saabit hua ke witr ki qaza nahi) aur mein nahi jaanti ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kabhi saara Quran aik raat mein padh liya ho (us se aik shab mein Quran khatm karna bidat saabit hua) na ye jaanti hun ke saari raat Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne subah tak namaz padhi (yani zara bhi na sauye na aaraam liya ho) aur na ye ke Ramazan ke siwa (koi aur) saara maheena rozah rakha ho phir mein Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas gaya aur un se ye saari hadees bayan ki to unhon ne kaha ke beshak Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne sach farmaya aur kaha ke agar mein un ke paas hota ya un ke paas jata to ye hadees bil-mushaafa sunta Sa'd ne kaha ke agar mujhe ye maloom hota ke Aap un ke paas nahi jatay to mein kabhi un ki baat Aap se na kehta "
"391","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne witr awwal raat mein aur darmiyan mein aur aakhir raat mein sab waqton mein ada kiye hain yahan tak ke Fajr ke waqt tak "
"392","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Sireen raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se poocha ke mujhe subah ki namaz se pehle ki do rakaton ke baaray mein batlaiye kiya mein un mein taweel qiraat karun Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam raat ko do do rakat padha kartay thay aur witr aik rakat padhtay thay (bin Sireen) kehtay hain ke mein ne kaha ke mein ye nahi poochta Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tum motay aadmi ho (yani moti aqal walay ho ke baat ke darmiyan hi mein bol uthay) kiya tum mujhe (poori) hadees bayan karnay ki fursat nahi detay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam raat ko do do rakat padhtay thay aur aik witr ada kartay thay aur do rakat subah ki farz namaz se pehle aisay waqt padhtay ke takbeer Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke kaan mein hoti (yani takbeer ke waqt padhtay aur zaahir hai ke us waqt jo namaz ho gi nihayat khafeef ho gi) "
"393","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jis ko us baat ka khauf ho ke aakhir shab mein na uth sakay ga to awwal shab mein (Isha ke baad) witr padh le aur jis ko umeed ho ke aakhir shab mein uthay ga to chahiye ke witr aakhir shab mein padhay us liye ke shab ki namaz aisi hai ke us mein farishtay haazir hotay hain aur ye afzal hai "
"394","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : subah se pehle witr padh liya karo "
"395","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya tum mein se koi ye pasand karta hai ke jab wo apne ghar ki taraf lautay to us mein teen moti hamila oontniyan paye ham ne arz kiya ke ji haan to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ” tum mein se kisi ka namaz mein teen aayaat ka padhna teen moti taazi hamila oontnion se behtar hai “ "
"396","[AI-translation] ´Abu Wail (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham aik din Fajr ki namaz padh kar subah subah Abdullah bin Mas'ud raziyallahu anhuma ke ghar gaye pas ham ne darwazay par kharay ho kar salam kaha to hamein ijazat de gayi Wail kehtay hain ke ham thori dair darwazay par thehray rahay to aik bachi nikli kehnay lagi ke Aap andar daakhil kyun nahi hotay Chunanche ham andar daakhil ho gaye to dekha ke Abdullah bin Mas'ud raziyallahu anhuma baithay tasbeeh padh rahay thay farmanay lagay ke jab tumhein ijazat de gayi thi to tumhein andar daakhil honay se kis cheez ne roka ham ne kaha aur kuch nahi ham ne khayal kiya ke Aap ke baaz ghar walay sauye hun ge Abdullah bin Mas'ud raziyallahu anhuma farmanay lagay ke tum ne bin Umm Abd ke ahl khana ko ghafil khayal kiya hai phir wo tasbeeh mein mashghool ho gaye yahan tak ke unhon ne gumaan kiya ke sooraj nikal aaya hai Aap ne bachi se kaha dekho sooraj nikal aaya hai Wail kehtay hain pas us ne dekh kar kaha ke nahi abhi sooraj tuloo nahi hua wo phir tasbeeh mein mashghool ho gaye yahan tak ke unhon ne gumaan kiya ke sooraj nikal aaya hai Aap ne phir bachi se kaha dekho sooraj nikal aaya hai to us ne dekh kar kaha ji haan sooraj tuloo ho chuka hai to farmanay lagay ke tamam tareef Allah Rab Aalameen ke liye hai jis ne maaf kar diya ham ko hamaray us din mein Mahdi kehtay hain mera khayal hai ke Abdullah bin Mas'ud raziyallahu anhuma ne kaha ” aur hamein hamaray gunaahon ke sabab halaak nahi kiya “ to logon mein se aik aadmi ne kaha ke mein ne aaj ki raat saari ki saari mufassal surtein padhi hain to Abdullah bin Mas'ud raziyallahu anhuma ne kaha haaza kahazza ash-shir tum ne aisay padha jaisa koi shair padhta hai ham ne albatta qarayin ko suna hai aur mujhe wo qarayin yaad hain jinhein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam padha kartay thay wo athhara surtein mufassal ki aur do surtein aal ha-meem se hain (qarayin se wo surtein muraad hain jinhein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam do do surtein mila kar aik rakat mein padha kartay thay)"
"397","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (taqreeban) aadhi raat ko niklay aur masjid mein namaz padhi aur chand logon ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz ada ki phir subah log us ka zikr karnay lagay aur doosray din us se zyada log jama hue aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi niklay phir logon ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz ada ki aur subah ko log us ka zikr karnay lagay phir teesri raat mein masjid mein zyada log jama hue aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam niklay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath logon ne namaz ada ki phir jab chauthi raat hui aur log us qadar jama hue ke masjid tang par gayi aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam na niklay to log ” namaz namaz “ pukaarnay lagay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam na niklay yahan tak ke subah ki namaz ko aaye phir jab namaz padh chukay to logon ki taraf munh kiya aur shahadatain padha aur hamd o salat ke baad farmaya ke maloom ho ke tumhara aaj ki raat ka haal mujh par kuch posheeda na tha magar mein ne khauf kiya ke tum par raat ki namaz (taraweeh) farz na ho jaye aur tum us ki adayigi se aajiz ho jao aur aik riwayat mein hai ke ye Ramazan ka waqia tha "
"398","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Ramazan mein taraweeh padhnay ki targheeb detay thay taakeedan hukm nahi detay thay aur farmatay : jo Ramazan mein iman ke saath aur sawab hasil karnay ke liye namaz padhay to us ke aglay gunah bakhshay jayein ge phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne inteqal farmaya aur muamla usi tarah tha phir Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ki khilafat mein bhi yehi tareeqa raha phir Umar raziyallahu anhu ki shuru khilafat mein bhi yehi tareeqa raha (yani jis ka dil chahta raat ko namaz padhta) "
